<section class="ex-note" id="def">
<h2>1. Definition &amp; Classification（定義與分類）</h2>
<p>Lipodystrophies 是一群以 <strong>selective loss of adipose tissue</strong>（選擇性脂肪組織流失）為特徵的異質性疾病，分為 genetic 與 acquired 兩大類。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></p>
<ul>
<li>依脂肪流失範圍：localized（小區域）、partial（e.g. 四肢）、generalized（全身）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
<li>依脂肪流失範圍，病人可能容易出現 insulin resistance 相關併發症：diabetes mellitus、dyslipidemia、hepatic steatosis、acanthosis nigricans、polycystic ovarian disease、coronary heart disease。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
<li>脂肪流失範圍決定代謝併發症（diabetes、hypertriglyceridemia、hepatic steatosis、acanthosis nigricans）的嚴重度。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Type（類型）</th><th scope="col">Subtypes／Genes（亞型／基因）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>AR congenital generalized lipodystrophy（CGL）</td><td>Type 1 <em>AGPAT2</em>；Type 2 <em>BSCL2</em>；Type 3 <em>CAV1</em>；Type 4 <em>CAVIN1</em>；others</td></tr>
<tr><td>AD familial partial lipodystrophy（FPL）</td><td>Dunnigan variety <em>LMNA</em>；<em>PPARG</em>；<em>AKT2</em>；<em>PLIN1</em>；<em>ADRA2A</em>；others</td></tr>
<tr><td>AR familial partial lipodystrophy</td><td><em>CIDEC</em>、<em>LIPE</em>、<em>PCYT1A</em>、<em>RECQL2</em></td></tr>
<tr><td>AR mandibuloacral dysplasia（MAD）–associated</td><td><em>LMNA</em>、<em>ZMPSTE24</em>、others</td></tr>
<tr><td>Other <em>LMNA</em>-associated</td><td>Atypical progeroid syndrome、Hutchinson-Gilford progeria syndrome</td></tr>
<tr><td>SHORT syndrome</td><td><em>PIK3R1</em></td></tr>
<tr><td>Neonatal progeroid（Wiedemann-Rautenstrauch）syndrome</td><td><em>FBN1</em>、<em>CAV1</em>、<em>POLR3A</em></td></tr>
<tr><td>Mandibular hypoplasia, deafness, progeroid（MDP）syndrome</td><td><em>POLD1</em></td></tr>
<tr><td>Autoinflammatory lipodystrophy（JMP spectrum，含 CANDLE）</td><td><em>PSMB8</em></td></tr>
<tr><td>Acquired：HAART-induced（HIV）</td><td>—</td></tr>
<tr><td>Acquired generalized</td><td>Panniculitis induced、autoimmune diseases associated、idiopathic</td></tr>
<tr><td>Acquired partial（Barraquer-Simons）</td><td>Autoimmune diseases associated、membranoproliferative glomerulonephritis associated、idiopathic</td></tr>
<tr><td>Localized</td><td>Panniculitis induced、pressure induced、drug induced、centrifugal、idiopathic</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 74-1，p.1296。</p>
<ul>
<li>McKee 分類：familial（generalized＝Berardinelli-Seip；partial＝Dunnigan 與 Köbberling variants）、acquired（generalized＝Lawrence；partial＝Barraquer-Simons；HIV-associated）、localized lipoatrophy（drug-induced、pressure-induced、panniculitis-associated、centrifugal variant、idiopathic）。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.380</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="epi">
<h2>2. Epidemiology（流行病學）</h2>
<ul>
<li>依約 <strong class="ex-n">1200</strong> 例文獻，genetic lipodystrophies 盛行率可能 <strong class="ex-n">&lt;1 in a million</strong>；女性較易辨識，因此報告較多。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
<li>CGL：約 <strong class="ex-n">500</strong> 例，在 consanguinity 較高的 Lebanon 與 Brazil 群聚；土耳其盛行率約 <strong class="ex-n">1 in 2 million</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
<li>FPL Dunnigan variety 最常見（約 <strong class="ex-n">500</strong> 例）；<em>PPARG</em> 型約 <strong class="ex-n">40</strong> 例。因 founder mutations，FPL Dunnigan type 在 Ontario 盛行率估計可高達 <strong class="ex-n">1:200,000</strong>，Reunion Island 約 <strong class="ex-n">1:20,000</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
<li>MAD：<em>LMNA</em> 型約 <strong class="ex-n">30</strong> 例，<em>ZMPSTE24</em> 型 <strong class="ex-n">15</strong> 例。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
<li>Acquired partial lipodystrophy：約 <strong class="ex-n">250–300</strong> 例，各種族，M:F <strong class="ex-n">1:4</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
<li>Acquired generalized lipodystrophy：<strong class="ex-n">&lt;100</strong> 例，多為白人，M:F <strong class="ex-n">1:3</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
<li><strong>目前最常見的類型</strong>是 HIV 病人使用含 protease inhibitors（PIs）的 HAART 所致 lipodystrophy，估計美國超過 <strong class="ex-n">100,000</strong> 人。<span class="ex-ref">p.1295</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>McKee 的盛行率數字與 Fitzpatrick 不同：CGL 從 Lebanon <strong class="ex-n">1:200 000</strong> 到美國 <strong class="ex-n">1:12 000 000</strong>，全球約 <strong class="ex-n">1:10 000 000</strong>；FPL Dunnigan 估計 <strong class="ex-n">&lt;1 in 15 000 000</strong>。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.380</span> McKee 寫 acquired partial lipodystrophy 是 lipodystrophy 中較常見的 variants 之一，女性為男性的三倍。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.381</span></aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="cgl">
<h2>3. Congenital Generalized Lipodystrophy（Berardinelli-Seip syndrome）</h2>
<h3>Clinical features（臨床表現）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Autosomal recessive，<strong class="ex-n">4</strong> 個 subtypes；出生時或之後不久即因幾乎完全沒有體脂肪而可辨識。<span class="ex-ref">p.1296</span></li>
<li>Marked muscularity、prominent subcutaneous veins、acromegaloid features、acanthosis nigricans、hepatomegaly、umbilical prominence。</li>
<li>兒童期 voracious appetite 與 accelerated linear growth。</li>
<li>女性通常有 hirsutism、clitoromegaly、oligomenorrhea、polycystic ovaries；只有少數女性成功懷孕；部分男性可能因 teratozoospermia 影響生育。</li>
<li>部分病人青春期後出現 hypertrophic cardiomyopathy、mild mental retardation、appendicular bones 的 focal lytic lesions。</li>
<li>Insulin resistance 相關代謝異常（diabetes、hyperlipidemia、hepatic steatosis）可能在年輕時出現，常難以控制。<span class="ex-ref">p.1296</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Genetics（基因與機轉）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Gene（基因）</th><th scope="col">Chromosome</th><th scope="col">Function（功能）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><em>AGPAT2</em>（CGL1）</td><td>9q34</td><td>由 glycerol-3-phosphate 合成 triglycerides 與 phospholipids 的關鍵酵素，脂肪組織高度表現</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>BSCL2</em>（CGL2）</td><td>11q13</td><td>Seipin：lipid droplet fusion，也可能參與 adipocyte differentiation</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>CAV1</em>（CGL3）</td><td>7q31</td><td>Caveolin 1：caveolae 的組成；結合 fatty acids 並送到 lipid droplets</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>CAVIN1</em>（又稱 <em>PTRF</em>，CGL4）</td><td>17q21</td><td>Caveolae biogenesis，調控 caveolins 1 與 3 表現</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">p.1296。</p>
<ul>
<li><em>BSCL2</em> 突變者連 <strong>mechanical fat</strong>（orbital、palm、sole、periarticular）也缺乏，另加 metabolically active fat；<em>AGPAT2</em>、<em>CAV1</em>、<em>PTRF</em> 突變者 mechanical fat 保留。<span class="ex-ref">p.1296</span></li>
<li>唯一報告的 <em>CAV1</em> 突變病人另有 short stature 與 presumed vitamin D resistance。<span class="ex-ref">p.1296</span></li>
<li><em>CAVIN1</em> 突變僅約 <strong class="ex-n">15</strong> 例：congenital myopathy、CK 上升、percussion-induced myoedema、pyloric stenosis、atlantoaxial instability、cardiac rhythm disturbances（prolonged QT、exercise-induced ventricular tachycardia，可導致 sudden death）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1296–1297</span></li>
<li>Lebanese 病人帶 homozygous <em>BSCL2</em> 突變；African origin 病人幾乎都是 <em>AGPAT2</em> c.589–2A&gt;G 突變（homozygous 或 compound heterozygous）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1297</span></li>
</ul>
